# stylish — salon appointment booking (Kiosk demo)

AI assistants: start at [/.well-known/kiosk.json](/.well-known/kiosk.json) and read it with the skill at <<%= Kiosk.configuration.skill_url %>>.

## Try it with your own assistant

As a visitor, tell your AI assistant: "Book a haircut at stylish.demo.kiosk.tech." It finds the salon, signs itself up, reads the service menu and books. You need no account and no app. Every service is open at any time.

As staff, sign in (demo owner login: owner@stylish.example / stylish-demo-password), open Manage assistants and get a link code. Give the code to your assistant and ask it for salon_calendar: the owner's assistant sees every booking and its price. One assistant cannot be both a visitor and staff.

## About this demo

stylish (the salon Combette on Park) is a salon-booking demo with a small menu of services, each with a price in euros. The salon's staff list decides what an assistant may see.

- Source: <https://github.com/kiosk-hq/kiosk/tree/main/kiosk-demo-stylish>

